docs {
  # MeetingsService.JoinSession

  Enters a session: hosts any time, the rest from 15 minutes before the start to 30 after the end. Logs the entry

  `/ltedu.meetings.v1.MeetingsService/JoinSession` · unary · `ltedu/meetings/v1/meetings.proto`

  ## Request — `JoinSessionRequest`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `institution_slug` | `string` |  |
  | `source` | `string` |  |
  | `id` | `string` |  |

  ## Response — `JoinSessionResponse`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `session` | `Session` |  |
  | `meet_url` | `string` | meet: the link to open |
  | `server_url` | `string` | platform: connect to server_url with token |
  | `token` | `string` |  |
  | `room_name` | `string` |  |
  | `identity` | `string` |  |
  | `display_name` | `string` |  |

  ## Tipos

  ### `Session`

  | Campo | Tipo | Descripción |
  |---|---|---|
  | `source` | `string` |  |
  | `id` | `string` |  |
  | `title` | `string` |  |
  | `context` | `string` | Subject and grade, "Tutoría virtual" or "Psicología" |
  | `starts_at` | `string` | RFC 3339 |
  | `duration_min` | `int32` |  |
  | `provider` | `string` |  |
  | `host_name` | `string` |  |
  | `is_host` | `bool` |  |

  Errores: status gRPC con un `ltedu.common.v1.ErrorDetail` (code, message, fields) en los details.
